  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "or a different one, that would allow e.g. custom profile pictures and a better search.\nWhile i have not hosted these platforms myself yet, in my search for canny alterantives I stumbled over these two open source ones:\nhttps://github.com/riggraz/astuto\nhttps://github.com/getfider/fider\n---------\nThe main advantages of such a platform would be:\n- better search (tag filtering, etc.)\n- UI to keep track of posts voted on\n- actually setting profile pictures, you said in (I can't find the post anymore), that it is not possible here due to issues with canny, maybe those issues wouldn't be present on alternative platforms.\nI'm sure there would be other advantages such as styling (you can load your own stylesheet to make it fit to the game UI style (2px solid border, border-radius: 8px, background color, etc.) )\nor better integration into the main website.\nMigrating posts shouldn't be a big problem either, astuto specifically states, that they are a canny clone, and should support all the core features of canny",
